{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lost Child Demo</strong> is a walking simulator with elements of psychological horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo does not include the full story \u2014 it only offers a glimpse of what awaits players in the final version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646880/extras/LostBanuhod.gif?t=1744297254\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The main goal is to convey the atmosphere, visual style, and core mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The protagonist, Andrey, works as a children's party entertainer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Walk through endless corridors, listen carefully to the sounds, and look for changes in your surroundings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646880/extras/LustraGif.gif?t=1744297254\" /> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Psychological horror with a deep narrative</strong> \u2013 Uncover a dark mystery by piecing together fragments of the past.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A shifting world</strong> \u2013 The corridors have a life of their own, twisting and adapting to the protagonist's fears.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>References to real events</strong> \u2013 Subtle details that will make you think twice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Immersive sound design</strong> \u2013 Whispers behind your back, echoes of footsteps, and haunting noises pull you deeper into the atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Photorealistic graphics</strong> \u2013 Powered by Unreal Engine 5.4, the horror feels closer than ever before</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3646880?t=1744297254","background_ra